re, the major axis has length $2b=2\\cdot 9=18,$ and the minor axis has length $2a=2\\cdot 8=16.$" 13194139535756 true] [17592186364912 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364913 13194139535756 true] [17592186364912 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535756 true] [17592186364912 1041 "field-1" 13194139535756 true] [17592186364912 1104 #edb/ref 17592186364913 13194139535756 true] [17592186364912 1110 #uuid "07ae303a-1806-59e4-862b-f4d90cb6dee5" 13194139535756 true] [17592186364913 1034 "18" 13194139535756 true] [17592186364913 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535756 true] [17592186364913 1111 #uuid "173d5454-ac84-5d48-afe0-50162151c129" 13194139535756 true] [17592186364914 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364915 13194139535756 true] [17592186364914 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535756 true] [17592186364914 1041 "field-2" 13194139535756 true] [17592186364914 1104 #edb/ref 17592186364915 13194139535756 true] [17592186364914 1110 #uuid "afb398b0-621b-5f27-85ba-fcb70b84b070" 13194139535756 true] [17592186364915 1034 "16" 13194139535756 true] [17592186364915 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535756 true] [17592186364915 1111 #uuid "a3270874-4ab8-5eaf-b598-df9759447931" 13194139535756 true] [17592186364916 1017 #edb/ref 17592186364917 13194139535756 true] [17592186364916 1017 #edb/ref 17592186364919 13194139535756 true] [17592186364916 1089 "q-279197" 13194139535756 true] [17592186364916 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535756 true] [17592186364916 1100 "For the ellipse $\\frac{{x}^{2}}{12}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{49}=1,$ find the lengths of its major and minor axes.\n\n$\\,$ The length of the major axis is \n{{field-1}}.\n\n$\\,$ The length of the minor axis is \n{{field-2}}." 13194139535756 true] [17592186364916 1113 #uuid "f61c15c3-c5e4-51d0-92b3-8d15a9693b10" 13194139535756 true] [17592186364916 1145 "Remember that the equation of an ellipse centered at the origin with a horizontal radius of length $a$ and a vertical radius of length $b$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\n \n\nIn the given equation, we have ${a}^{2}=12$ and ${b}^{2}=49.$\n\n- Since ${a}^{2}=12,$ the length of the horizontal radius must be $a=\\sqrt{12}=2\\sqrt{3}.$\n\n- Since ${b}^{2}=49,$ the length of the vertical radius must be $b=\\sqrt{49}=7.$\n\nThus, the semi-major axis has length $b=7,$ and the semi-minor axis has length $a=2\\sqrt{3}.$\n\nTherefore, the major axis has length $2b=2\\cdot 7=14,$ and the minor axis has length $2a=2\\cdot 2\\sqrt{3}=4\\sqrt{3}.$" 13194139535756 true] [17592186364917 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364918 13194139535756 true] [17592186364917 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535756 true] [17592186364917 1041 "field-1" 13194139535756 true] [17592186364917 1104 #edb/ref 17592186364918 13194139535756 true] [17592186364917 1110 #uuid "547840e5-e2c6-55cc-a546-f0b5a4fef4b8" 13194139535756 true] [17592186364918 1034 "14" 13194139535756 true] [17592186364918 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535756 true] [17592186364918 1111 #uuid "eb91877a-ccf5-5658-b78b-406e5f542824" 13194139535756 true] [17592186364919 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364920 13194139535756 true] [17592186364919 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535756 true] [17592186364919 1041 "field-2" 13194139535756 true] [17592186364919 1104 #edb/ref 17592186364920 13194139535756 true] [17592186364919 1110 #uuid "c2fa5e92-fa08-5fa9-a344-01e05204d764" 13194139535756 true] [17592186364920 1034 "4\\sqrt{3}" 13194139535756 true] [17592186364920 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535756 true] [17592186364920 1111 #uuid "41ed2d11-31c8-546a-8a9b-52397f12bb38" 13194139535756 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-115123" 17592186364897 "q-115123/selection" 17592186364898 "q-115123/selection/24f3dbe0eca24efe024dbbccb7e4d709fa4263d1ba3dab136fe8272b18a6a786" 17592186364899 "q-115123/selection/3e1b9bbb008493e1acc01324701cac4a2fc94f100f50443482e7556322783d63" 17592186364900 "q-115123/selection/ab288c8a5e845bfb1d1eacff333b4ce62c2bff8fbd185918ecf131dd5fcf72a1" 17592186364901 "q-115123/